<section id="scene-10" class="scene scene-surface" aria-label="FAQ" data-scene="10">
  <div class="faq-wrap">
    <h2 class="h2" style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)">Quiet answers.</h2>
    <div style="margin-top:2.5rem">
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Will it fit my desk? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Any edge between 20 and 75 mm thick — solid wood, laminate, marble, metal. Not glass: the clamp grips hard, and glass doesn&rsquo;t like being gripped.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>How much weight does it hold? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Tested to 22 kg. The average cat is 4–5 kg. Even a very committed Maine Coon has a comfortable margin.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Will it scratch my desk? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>No. Both jaws are felt-padded, and the knob is hand-tightened — you control the pressure. No marks, no residue.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>What if my cat ignores it? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Give it a day, and try a pinch of catnip in the basket — most cats claim it within 24 hours. If yours holds out for 30 days, send it back. Full refund, no questions, no guilt.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Can I wash it? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Yes. The plush cover unzips off the frame and machine-washes on a gentle cycle. Air-dry, fluff, zip back on.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Is there any assembly? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>About three minutes, no tools: slip the cover over the frame, zip it closed, clamp it to your desk. Everything you need is in the box.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Can I fold it out of the way? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Yes — lift the basket and press the side button, and it folds flat against the desk edge. One click down, one lift back up. The clamp stays put.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Does it work on standing desks? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Yes — just give the knob a check-turn after big height changes. The clamp doesn&rsquo;t mind the ride.</p>
      </details>
      <details class="faq">
        <summary>Shipping? <span class="faq__plus" aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary>
        <p>Dispatched within 48 hours, tracked, free over $60. 30-day returns from the day it arrives.</p>
      </details>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

